    &ug ___    &ug PINK   &ug TEAL   &ug BLUE   &ug GREEN  &ug RED    &ug ___      &ug ___    &ug RED    &ug WHITE  &ug GOLD   &ug ORANGE &ug YELLOW &ug ___
